# The scope rules A, B1-B5 and C are in macro-benchmark/README.md;
# pyfiglet.md shows how this ledger applies them and records each judgement
# (J1 to J8). No trace exists: every edge comes from reading. Supported
# runtimes: CPython 3.9 and later (setup.py python_requires=">=3.9"; no other
# implementation is declared), on Unix only (J1). The package's
# own resources can be a directory or a zip import (J2). Fonts, text,
# directions and justifications are strs (annotations); no package object
# reaches a str parameter with a method that pyfiglet overrides.

